      <p>To locate the <code>CredentialsRequest</code> CRs that are required, see "Manually creating long-term credentials for Google Cloud".</p>
      </dd>
      <dt class="font-semibold">Red Hat OpenStack Platform (RHOSP) permissions</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>To install an OpenShift Container Platform cluster on RHOSP, the CCO requires a credential with the permissions of a <code>member</code> user role.</p></dd>
