      <p>If <code>CredentialsRequest</code> CRs change over time as the cluster is upgraded, you must manually update the passthrough mode credential to meet the requirements. To avoid credentials issues during an upgrade, check the <code>CredentialsRequest</code> CRs in the release image for the new version of OpenShift Container Platform before upgrading.</p>
